       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CUSTPURG.
      *****************************************************************
      * INCLUDES THE CUSTOMER COPYBOOK BUT NEVER TOUCHES CUST_NAME.    *
      * NOTHING FLOWS INTO OR OUT OF THE WIDENED FIELD HERE - YET THE  *
      * COPYBOOK THIS PROGRAM COMPILES AGAINST STILL CHANGES SHAPE, SO *
      * IT STILL HAS TO BE REBUILT. THAT IS THE WHOLE POINT OF THE     *
      * RECOMPILE-ONLY LIST.                                           *
      *****************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE CUSTOMER END-EXEC.
       01  WS-PURGE-COUNT           PIC S9(9)       COMP-3.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           EXEC SQL
               DELETE FROM CUSTOMER
                WHERE CUST_STATUS = 'X'
           END-EXEC
           ADD 1 TO WS-PURGE-COUNT
           GOBACK.
